<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.telemetry.projects ~ telemetry through the seat, verbatim first

`lares sense telemetry wing=<w>` runs lar-telemetry over a wing through the daemon seat, projecting the turn's instrument readings as `lar_*` onto its drawers; `limit=N` caps the drawers one pass touches. Idempotent: the lar_hv gate skips current drawers, and a down daemon no-ops, the verbatim capture already landed.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ telemetry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`telemetry` params=`wing/claude limit/200 ~ project readings onto a wing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ wing · limit

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the wing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`limit` params=`takes/count ~ the drawers this pass touches`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ rides the daemon's composed caps, the single-owner law; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ not-found · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`~ no daemon seat answers`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ the projection refused; its message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ projected

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`projected` params=`exit/0 ~ the drawers projected`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sense telemetry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sense telemetry]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

